  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Rapid Response Fund</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Rapid Response Fund</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med &quot;Rapid Response Fund&quot; &#xE4;r att kunna bidra till FN:s och andra internationella initiativs insatser inom omr&#xE5;dena fred, f&#xF6;rsoning och demokratisk samh&#xE4;llsstyrning. Detta inneb&#xE4;r att fonden kan anv&#xE4;ndas till mindre projekt med relativt snabb hantering.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of the Rapid Response Fund is to be able to respond to UN and other international initiatives in the sectors of peace, reconciliation and democratic governance. This means that the Fund can be used for smaller projects with a relatively quick processing period.</narrative>
  </description>
